    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "wahyuyassin@gmail.com",
        "subject": "Invoice Training",
        "message": "=<div style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background-color: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n    <h2 style=\"margin: 0;\">INVOICE TAGIHAN</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin: 5px 0 0;\">Invoice Training</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #dddddd;\">\n\n    <p>Yth. <strong>{{ $('On form submission').item.json['Nama Klien'] }}</strong>,</p>\n\n    <p>Terima kasih telah menggunakan jasa kami. Berikut ringkasan tagihan atas pekerjaan yang telah dilakukan.</p>\n\n    <h3 style=\"color: #2563eb;\">Ringkasan Tagihan</h3>\n\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0;\">\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #dddddd; background-color: #f3f4f6;\">Nama Klien</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #dddddd;\">{{ $('On form submission').item.json['Nama Klien'] }}</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #dddddd; background-color: #f3f4f6;\">Jam Kerja</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #dddddd;\">{{ $('On form submission').item.json['Jam Kerja'] }} jam</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #dddddd; background-color: #f3f4f6;\">Total Biaya</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #dddddd; color: #2563eb; font-size: 18px;\">\n          <strong>{{ $(\"Edit Fields\").first().json[\"Total Biaya\"] }}</strong>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n\n    <p>Invoice lengkap tersedia dalam file PDF yang kami lampirkan pada email ini. Silakan periksa rincian tagihan tersebut.</p>\n\n    <p>Apabila terdapat pertanyaan mengenai tagihan, silakan membalas email ini.</p>\n\n    <p>Terima kasih atas kepercayaan Anda.</p>\n\n    <p>Hormat kami,<br><strong>Tim Administrasi</strong></p>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 12px; text-align: center; color: #666666; font-size: 12px;\">\n    Email ini dikirim secara otomatis melalui workflow n8n.\n  </div>\n\n</div>",
